WEBVTT

00:03:27.958 --> 00:03:31.059
she may have been able to see
that in that moment,

00:03:31.083 --> 00:03:34.601
Vicky just wasn't prepared for touch.

00:03:34.625 --> 00:03:36.809
Our hearts may have been
in the right place,

00:03:36.833 --> 00:03:41.083
but we made it about us
instead of focusing on her.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.476
In complete contrast,

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:44.976
more recently,

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.542
I met a woman -- let's call her Monica.

00:03:48.417 --> 00:03:50.143
I was tasked to tell Monica

00:03:50.167 --> 00:03:53.250
that her husband had tragically
taken his own life.

00:03:54.417 --> 00:03:58.268
She fell to the floor crying so hard
she could barely breathe.

00:03:58.292 --> 00:04:01.559
The gravity of that moment was so strong,